Maintainer: Rodrigo M. R. de Medeiros <rodrigo.matheus@live.com>
Description: An EM algorithm for maximum likelihood estimation in the correlated 
    destructive negative binomial cure rate model. This model describes the time
    until a specific event occurs (e.g., patient survival times). He assumes that
    the occurrence of the event in the population is due to several competing
    causes, which can be correlated. The model also deals with the possibility
    of a fraction of individuals who are not susceptible to that event.
